  <ThingDef ParentName="JJK_PuppetRaceBase">
    <defName>JJK_PandaConstruct</defName>
    <label>panda-type cursed corpse</label>
    <description>An independent-type cursed corpse with three compatible soul cores. At 45 days it replenishes its own energy and no longer occupies its creator's control limit. Its Independent companion panel enables friendships, naming, social visits and hauling, rescue or guard routines. Visits build trust and comfort colonists. Losing a friend or core causes grief; company helps it recover. It can use physical repair kits and keeps operating after its creator dies. Balanced Panda form conserves energy; Gorilla form strikes harder and faster, draining energy for armor-ignoring Drumming Beat hits. Sister form uses a defensive role as a gameplay adaptation: its canon attacks remain unknown. Damaged cores temporarily disable their forms below 25% health. Destroyed cores permanently remove those forms; losing all three kills the construct. Changing form never heals it. Uses distinct vanilla silhouettes.</description>
    <race>
      <body>JJK_ThreeCoreBody</body>
      <baseHealthScale>2</baseHealthScale>
    </race>
    <comps>
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_CursedCorpse" />
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_ThreeCores" />
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_IndependentCompanion" />
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="JJK_PuppetRaceBase">
    <defName>JJK_AbsolutePuppet</defName>
    <label>ultimate mechamaru — mode: absolute</label>
    <description>A giant piloted cursed corpse. Its bound Grade 1 Puppet Manipulation controller must physically enter the cockpit. Stores up to 2400 energy, transferred from sorcerers in 50-CE deposits. One-year charge costs 120; Miracle Cannon 240; Pigeon Viola 600. These are gameplay costs, not literal years. Load up to four crafted Simple Domain cartridges for cockpit sure-hit protection or a close-range domain injection. Damage to the frame persists; destruction or incapacitation ejects the actual pilot.</description>
    <race>
      <baseBodySize>4</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>8</baseHealthScale>
    </race>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3.8</MoveSpeed>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.8</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.6</ArmorRating_Blunt>
    </statBases>
    <tools Inherit="false">
      <li>
        <label>giant fist</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>45</power>
        <cooldownTime>3</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <armorPenetration>0.7</armorPenetration>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_CursedCorpse">
        <mech>true</mech>
      </li>
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_AbsolutePuppet" />
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="JJK_PuppetRaceBase">
    <defName>JJK_CommunicationPuppet</defName>
    <label>mini-mechamaru communicator</label>
    <description>A small noncombat communication puppet with a finite core. Warns of hostile pawns within 30 tiles and line of sight, and lets you jump to a detected contact. Record a message for a one-time transmission after the creator's death. It keeps operating on remaining energy without the creator, then shuts down. Up to three relays per creator, separate from combat slots. Standby stops scanning and conserves charge.</description>
    <race>
      <baseBodySize>0.2</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.5</baseHealthScale>
    </race>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3</MoveSpeed>
    </statBases>
    <tools Inherit="false" />
    <comps>
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_CursedCorpse" />
      <li Class="JJKMod.CompProperties_CommunicationPuppet" />
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
